This is a good test, but note that you normally do not have setup the
CDF explicitly, but it will be found automagically when you setup the
CEL set.

Also, I would say hide/move the smaller GenomeWideSNP_6.CDF file and
work only with the "full" one by renaming or linking to it as:

ln -s GenomeWideSNP_6.Full.CDF  GenomeWideSNP_6.CDF

This is what I do.

