Hi,

that comment in ?readCdf() has been there for a while and we haven't
had any further discussions on how, when and if readCdf() would be
removed.

I would say that you can safely rely on readCdf() for now, and
something will change eventually it won't be anything dramatical.
Kasper & Jim, do you agree?

Also, we are using readCdf() in convertCdf(), which you might want to
have a look at as well.

/Henrik

